additionalAbilities.description:
(Bonus Action) Shuu enters a rage for 1 minute. While raging, he has advantage on Strength checks and Strength saving throws, resistance to all damage, and his weapon attacks deal an extra 4 damage. The rage ends early if he is knocked unconscious or chooses to end it.
<avrae hidden>
{
  "_v": 2,
  "name": "Rage",
  "activation_type": 3,
  "automation": [
    {
      "type": "target",
      "target": "self",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "ieffect2",
          "name": "Rage",
          "duration": 10,
          "end": false,
          "stacking": false,
          "effects": {
            "resistances": [
              "acid",
              "bludgeoning",
              "cold",
              "fire",
              "force",
              "lightning",
              "necrotic",
              "piercing",
              "poison",
              "psychic",
              "radiant",
              "slashing",
              "thunder"
            ],
            "check_adv": [
              "strength"
            ],
            "save_adv": [
              "strength"
            ],
            "damage_bonus": "4"
          },
          "desc": "Advantage on Strength checks and saving throws, resistance to all damage, and +4 weapon damage for 1 minute.",
          "buttons": [
            {
              "label": "End Rage",
              "automation": [
                {
                  "type": "remove_ieffect"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</avrae>

When Shuu makes his first attack on his turn, he can gain advantage on all melee weapon attack rolls until the start of his next turn. Attack rolls against him have advantage during that time.
<avrae hidden>
{
  "_v": 2,
  "name": "Reckless Attack",
  "automation": [
    {
      "type": "target",
      "target": "self",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "ieffect2",
          "name": "Reckless Attack",
          "duration": 1,
          "end": false,
          "stacking": false,
          "effects": {
            "attack_advantage": 1
          },
          "desc": "Advantage on attack rolls until the start of his next turn (melee weapon attacks only). Attack rolls against him have advantage.",
          "buttons": [
            {
              "label": "End Reckless Attack",
              "automation": [
                {
                  "type": "remove_ieffect"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</avrae>

If Shuu drops to 0 hit points while raging and doesn't die outright, he can make a DC 10 Constitution saving throw. On a success, he drops to 1 hit point instead. The DC increases by 5 each time he uses this feature and resets after a Long Rest.
<avrae hidden>
{
  "_v": 2,
  "name": "Relentless Rage",
  "automation": [
    {
      "type": "target",
      "target": "self",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "save",
          "stat": "con",
          "dc": "10",
          "fail": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Shuu drops to 0 hit points as normal."
            }
          ],
          "success": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Shuu drops to 1 hit point instead of 0."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</avrae>

legendaryActions.description:
Each bandit ally within 60 ft. of Shuu that can hear him gains 15 temporary hit points and has advantage on the next attack roll it makes before the end of its next turn.
<avrae hidden>
{
  "_v": 2,
  "name": "Warlord's Roar",
  "automation": [
    {
      "type": "target",
      "target": "each",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "temphp",
          "amount": "15"
        },
        {
          "type": "ieffect2",
          "name": "Warlord's Roar",
          "duration": 1,
          "end": true,
          "stacking": false,
          "effects": {
            "attack_advantage": 1
          },
          "desc": "Advantage on the next attack roll it makes before the end of its next turn. Remove this effect after that attack.",
          "buttons": [
            {
              "label": "Advantage Used",
              "automation": [
                {
                  "type": "remove_ieffect"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</avrae>

Shuu slams his weapon into the ground. Each creature within 15 ft. of him must make a DC 21 Strength saving throw, taking 27 (6d8) bludgeoning damage and being knocked prone on a failed save, or half as much damage and not knocked prone on a success.
<avrae hidden>
{
  "_v": 2,
  "name": "Earthshaker Slam",
  "automation": [
    {
      "type": "roll",
      "dice": "(6d8)[bludgeoning]",
      "name": "damage",
      "displayName": "Damage"
    },
    {
      "type": "target",
      "target": "each",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "save",
          "stat": "str",
          "dc": "21",
          "fail": [
            {
              "type": "damage",
              "damage": "{damage}",
              "fixedValue": true
            },
            {
              "type": "ieffect2",
              "name": "Prone",
              "duration": -1,
              "end": false,
              "stacking": false,
              "effects": {
                "attack_advantage": -1
              },
              "desc": "Disadvantage on its attack rolls. Attack rolls against it have advantage from within 5 ft. and disadvantage otherwise. Standing up costs half its speed.",
              "buttons": [
                {
                  "label": "Stand Up",
                  "automation": [
                    {
                      "type": "remove_ieffect"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "success": [
            {
              "type": "damage",
              "damage": "({damage})/2",
              "fixedValue": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</avrae>
